@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {
  usecase "View Room Availability" as UC1
  usecase "Book Room" as UC2
  usecase "Cancel Booking" as UC3
  usecase "Block Room" as UC5
  usecase "Unblock Room" as UC6
  usecase "View Room Usage Report" as UC7
}

Student -- UC1
Student -- UC2
Student -- UC3

Administrator -- UC5
Administrator -- UC6
Administrator -- UC7

note right of UC2
  R4: a successful booking produces
  a confirmation (success guarantee, US-04).
  A1: touching bookings do not overlap.
end note

note right of UC3
  Success guarantee: a cancellation
  confirmation is produced (US-05).
end note

note right of UC5
  A2: blocking does not cancel existing
  bookings; R3 stops only new ones.
  UC5 and UC6 both trace to US-06.
end note
@enduml